  message: "CORRECTION: the return-type registry IS working in prometheus bakeoff (deep-20260409-054615 iter-002). Evidence: 3475 typed_receiver_call edges in prometheus hg.json (meta.evidence_type field, not top-level). The earlier investigation incorrectly checked the top-level evidence_type key which doesn't exist in the serialized schema — evidence_type lives in meta.evidence_type.\n\nThe 708 chained_call_unresolved edges are a SEPARATE class of problem (inline chained calls, tracked in WI-vadin). Phase 1 var-assignment chaining is confirmed working. Moving INV-dihos to satisfied."  # c808
